 "remarks": "Clean and cheerful house on a serene country settings. Everything is done for your comfort and enjoyment. All large rooms with hardwood floors throughout. Flexible floor plan with primary bedroom can be either on the first or second floor. Oversize 3-season sunroom. Private deck. 2-story outbuilding as a potential art studio/home office/arts & crafts space/tradesman workshop/warehouse. All together 5000+ SF of usable space in two buildings. Close to the local train station and historic Ridgefield Center. Award winning schools. Reference and credit checks required. No smokers. One pet ok but must be discussed with Landlord.",
